{"markdown":{"yaml":{"title":""},"containsRefs":false,"markdown":"\n\n```{=html}\n<div class=\"portfolio-section-heading\">\n  <h2>Featured Projects</h2>\n  <p>A collection of my work in data science, actuarial science, and statistical research.</p>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"portfolio-project-grid\">\n\n  <div class=\"portfolio-project-card\">\n    <img class=\"portfolio-project-image\"\n         src=\"images/projects/manual_similarity.png\"\n         alt=\"Similarity analysis of actuarial study materials\">\n\n    <div class=\"portfolio-project-content\">\n\n      <h2>Actuarial Exam Preparation Market Intelligence</h2>\n\n      <p class=\"portfolio-project-subtitle\">BattleActs</p>\n\n      <p>An end-to-end data science project exploring actuarial exam preparation materials through automated web scraping, product data collection, text mining, and comparative analysis.</p>\n\n      <div class=\"portfolio-tags\">\n        <span>Python</span>\n        <span>Selenium</span>\n        <span>Web Scraping</span>\n        <span>NLP</span>\n        <span>Data Visualization</span>\n        <span>Competitive Intelligence</span>\n      </div>\n\n      <a class=\"portfolio-project-button\"\n         href=\"https://github.com/maxinehb/battleacts-market-intelligence\"\n         target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">\n         View on GitHub ↗\n      </a>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"portfolio-project-card\">\n    <img class=\"portfolio-project-image\"\n         src=\"images/projects/smart.png\"\n         alt=\"Illustration of SMART trial branching and adaptive treatment pathways\">\n\n    <div class=\"portfolio-project-content\">\n\n      <h2>SMART Experiments: What Comes Next?</h2>\n\n      <p class=\"portfolio-project-subtitle\">Interactive Statistical Explainer</p>\n\n      <p>An interactive statistical explainer exploring Sequential Multiple Assignment Randomized Trials (SMARTs) as an extension of traditional A/B testing. Combines animated visualizations, a real clinical trial example, and Monte Carlo simulations to demonstrate adaptive treatment strategies, statistical estimation, and inference.</p>\n\n      <div class=\"portfolio-tags\">\n        <span>R</span>\n        <span>Quarto</span>\n        <span>Experimental Design</span>\n        <span>Monte Carlo Simulation</span>\n        <span>Statistical Inference</span>\n        <span>Data Visualization</span>\n        <span>JavaScript</span>\n      </div>\n\n      <div class=\"portfolio-project-links\">\n        <a class=\"portfolio-project-button\"\n           href=\"https://maxinehb.github.io/smart-experiments-explainer/\"\n           target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">\n           View Interactive Explainer ↗\n        </a>\n\n        <a class=\"portfolio-project-button secondary-button\"\n           href=\"https://github.com/maxinehb/smart-experiments-explainer\"\n           target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">\n           View on GitHub ↗\n        </a>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"portfolio-project-card\">\n    <div class=\"portfolio-project-placeholder\">☁️</div>\n\n    <div class=\"portfolio-project-content\">\n      <span class=\"portfolio-status in-progress\">In Progress</span>\n\n      <h2>Actuarial Text Mining</h2>\n\n      <p>Exploring thematic patterns and relationships within actuarial text using natural language processing, unsupervised machine learning, and clustering techniques.</p>\n\n      <div class=\"portfolio-tags\">\n        <span>Python</span>\n        <span>NLP</span>\n        <span>Machine Learning</span>\n        <span>Clustering</span>\n      </div>\n\n      <p class=\"portfolio-coming-soon\">Coming soon ♡</p>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"portfolio-closing\">\n  <p>More projects and discoveries to come! ♡</p>\n</div>\n```","srcMarkdownNoYaml":"\n\n```{=html}\n<div class=\"portfolio-section-heading\">\n  <h2>Featured Projects</h2>\n  <p>A collection of my work in data science, act